    <briefdescription>
<para>A <ref refid="classllvm_1_1orc_1_1_simple_compiler" kindref="compound">SimpleCompiler</ref> that owns its <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_target_machine" kindref="compound">TargetMachine</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is convenient for clients who don&apos;t want to own their TargetMachines, e.g. <ref refid="classllvm_1_1orc_1_1_l_l_j_i_t" kindref="compound">LLJIT</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
